Date: Thu, 12 Sep 2024 11:25:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 07/19] Ported PWM driver changes from INTEL & AMI.

Signed-off-by: saikumaru <saikumaru@ami.com>
---
 drivers/pwm/Kconfig              |  20 ++
 drivers/pwm/Makefile             |   2 +
 drivers/pwm/core.c               |  83 +++++-
 drivers/pwm/pwm-aspeed-ast2600.c | 370 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/pwm/pwm-fttmr010.c       | 437 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/linux/pwm.h              |  22 +-
